clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj12y7NFrGxp_iwbD4wjiNvHZLWYOvjT-ERtt6Dp4y7FrLT9vG2RAczCNlwvA0xMlIbDlstZToXUBXnsmMzVnTvRXNLvSzHUhzAnBTbfnYHB3Cua0PfZyF-mVlhTNvdm2mc3qRNCiV7qHsV2OZJ1Gv9BCeFNBze4YbVssBz8p50XNzl94xuxYod-C8wjCtX/s640/374%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"640\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj12y7NFrGxp_iwbD4wjiNvHZLWYOvjT-ERtt6Dp4y7FrLT9vG2RAczCNlwvA0xMlIbDlstZToXUBXnsmMzVnTvRXNLvSzHUhzAnBTbfnYHB3Cua0PfZyF-mVlhTNvdm2mc3qRNCiV7qHsV2OZJ1Gv9BCeFNBze4YbVssBz8p50XNzl94xuxYod-C8wjCtX/w450-h640/374%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#台灣人寫真 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\n<br /></span></b></